Offer forwarding only where the instance receives forwarded mail.

The API reports forwarding.enabled in /v1/mailboxes/connect-options
(INBOUND_SECRET or INBOUND_SMTP_ADDR set). Hide forwarding where there is no
inbound route, recommend the first non-advanced connection, and hide switching
an existing mailbox to forwarding. Preserve upstream's Collab API connections
and their priority. Missing or disabled forwarding options never imply an inbound
route, even when no other receiving method is available.

